{
  "name": "chainstack__remote-mcp",
  "display_name": "Chainstack",
  "description": "Remote MCP server for Chainstack — deploy and manage blockchain nodes, get RPC endpoints across 70+ protocols, search docs, check platform status, request testnet funds, and check pricing.",
  "homepage": "https://chainstack.com/mcp/",
  "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
  "instructions": "Connect with **no configuration** to use the public tools. Node/project management and the testnet faucet require a Chainstack API key.\n\n## Authentication\n\nFive tools work with **no auth**: `search_docs`, `get_doc_page`, `get_platform_status`, `get_chainstack_pricing`, `contact_chainstack`.\n\nThe node/project lifecycle tools and `request_testnet_funds` require a **Chainstack API key** (no OAuth). Create one at https://console.chainstack.com/user/settings/api-keys and send it as an `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header.\n\nConnection URL: `https://mcp.chainstack.com/mcp` (streamable HTTP).\n\nDocs: https://docs.chainstack.com/docs/chainstack-mcp-server",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "search_docs",
      "description": "Search Chainstack docs — RPC methods, node infrastructure, Web3 APIs, deployment guides, and code examples."
    },
    {
      "name": "get_doc_page",
      "description": "Get the full content of a Chainstack documentation page."
    },
    {
